      "sourceTextSha256": "6c49b4647a5f977a5cdad177b7ef5b362b6f645b36ba6fb143533da89a0ac083",
      "text": "Peru and Brazil in one journey offer an unusual combination of ancient history, mountain landscapes, major cities, waterfalls and the ocean. The route begins with Lima, Cusco, Machu Picchu and Lake Titicaca. You then fly to Brazil, where Iguaçu, Rio de Janeiro and a few days on the coast of Búzios await.",
